+/*
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
+ *
+ * GE8320 (Series 8XE), BVNC 22.87.104.18: the GPU of MediaTek's MT6765 (the Rabbit r1).
+ * Not an upstream entry (Darwin on redwood, tools/mesa/pvr-ge8320.patch).
+ *
+ * Where each value is from:
+ *   [FW]  the device-info block of the open firmware rogue_22.87.104.18_v1.fw
+ *   [KM]  Imagination's kernel-side DDK headers rgxconfig_km_22.V.104.18.h and
+ *         rgxcore_km_22.87.104.18.h (dual MIT/GPL; the same values in four public trees, e.g.
+ *         github.com/MediaTek-Labs/common-kernel-4.19 drivers/gpu/mediatek/gpu_rgx/
+ *         m1.11ED5425693/hwdefs/km/{configs,cores}/ and github.com/tomstokes/
+ *         ti-img-rogue-driver hwdefs/rogue/km/{configs,cores}/)
+ *   [8300] NOT SOURCED for this core: copied from Mesa's GE8300 22.V.54.38 (ge8300.h), the
+ *         nearest relative with an entry. These are user-mode-only values that neither the
+ *         firmware nor the KM headers carry; the authoritative source is the user-mode
+ *         rgxconfig_22.V.104.18.h of the closed DDK (or Imagination).
+ */
